      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-32-2021-october/q1",
      "question": "<p>A particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> moves with constant acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-2}}\"></span></p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is moving with velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4\\mathbf i\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find the velocity of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=2\"></span> seconds. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\"></span>, the position vector of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> relative to a fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\mathbf i+\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm m\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>Find the position vector of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> relative to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span> at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=3\"></span> seconds. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
