      "question": "<p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds, a particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> has velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}\"></span>, where</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=3t^{\\frac12}\\mathbf i-2t\\mathbf j\\qquad t&gt;0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find the acceleration of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t&gt;0\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> at the instant when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is moving in the direction of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t&gt;0\"></span>, the position vector of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span>, relative to a fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span>, is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\"></span> metres.</p><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=1\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=-\\mathbf j\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"3\"><li>Find an expression for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\"></span> in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Find the exact distance of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> from <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span> at the instant when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is moving with speed <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></li></ol>",
